lions place. .\n\nPutting it all together, starting from the right:.\n\nOnes: 4.\n\nTens: 4.\n\nHundreds:9.\n\nThousands:8.\n\nTen thousands:1.\n\nHundred thousands:1.\n\nMillions:5.\n\nTen millions:3.\n\nHundred millions:1.\n\nBillions:8. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
