lus the carried over 5 is 4.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\nStarting from the right:.\n\nOnes:3.\n\nTens:4.\n\nHundreds:2.\n\nThousands:3.\n\nTen thousands:7.\n\nHundred thousands:5.\n\nMillions:7.\n\nTen millions:4.\n\nHundred millions:3. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
