um of 338,712,736 and 377,849,524 is 716,562,260.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe sum of 338712736 and 377849524 is \\boxed{716562260}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the sum of 338,712,736 and 377,849,524, we align the numbers vertically and add each column starting from the rightmost digit, carrying over when necessary.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n 338,712,736 \\\\\n+377,849,524 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nStarting from the rightmost digit:\n- **Ones place**: \\(6 + 4 = 10\\) \u2192 write 0, carry over 1.\n- **Tens place**: \\(3 + 2 + 1 = 6\\) \u2192 write 6.\n- **Hundreds place**: \\(7 + 5 = 12\\) \u2192 write 2, carry over 1.\n- **Thousands place**: \\(2 + 9 + 1 = 12\\) \u2192 write 2, carry over 1.\n- **Ten thousands place**: \\(1 + 4 + 1 = 6\\) \u2192 write 6.\n- **Hundred thousands place**: \\(7 + 8 = 15\\) \u2192 write 5, carry over 1.\n- **Millions place**: \\(8 + 7 + 1 = 16\\) \u2192 write 6, carry over 1.\n- **Ten millions place**: \\(3 + 7 + 1 = 11\\) \u2192 write 1, carry over 1.\n- **Hundred millions place**: \\(3 + 3 + 1 = 7\\) \u2192 write 7.\n\nCombining all the digits from left to right, we get the result:\n\\[\n716,562,260\n\\]\n\nThus, the sum of 338,712,736 and 377,849,524 is \\(\\boxed{716562260}\\).",
