eded:\n\n1. **Units place**: \\(3 + 1 = 4\\)\n2. **Tens place**: \\(5 + 0 = 5\\)\n3. **Hundreds place**: \\(0 + 9 = 9\\)\n4. **Thousands place**: \\(4 + 9 = 13\\) (Write 3, carry over 1)\n5. **Ten thousands place**: \\(6 + 5 = 11 + 1 = 12\\) (Write 2, carry over 1)\n6. **Hundred thousands place**: \\(0 + 0 = 0 + 1 = 1\\)\n7. **Millions place**: \\(0 + 2 = 2\\)\n8. **Ten millions place**: \\(3 + 5 = 8\\)\n9. **Hundred millions place**: \\(7 + 5 = 12\\) (Write 2, carry over 1)\n\nIncluding the carryover from the hundred millions place to the billions place:\n\n- **Billions place**: 1\n\nCombining all the digits from left to right, the result is 1,282,123,954.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1282123954}\n\\]",
